  4926                           ;	Data EEPROM Memory Code Protection bit
  4927                           ;	CPD = OFF, Data EEPROM code protection off
  4928                           ;	Flash Program Memory Write Enable bits
  4929                           ;	WRT = OFF, Write protection off; all program memory may be written to by EECON control
